    "body": "## WORKSTREAM A — W01 FIRST RESULT EXECUTION / FAIL-CLOSED\n\n**RESULT**\n- Fresh execution was attempted only for `W01 = ARM_RAISE` under durable OWNER authority `5485989573`.\n- `W01 = FAIL` from actual visual evidence.\n- `W02..W06` were not started.\n- No redesign/spec/framework/camera/world/S001 work was opened.\n\n**DELTA**\n- The previous frozen-source visibility blocker was materially reduced by changing recovery path from old invisible Library IDs to durable provenance/hash mapping.\n- Three current Library handles were materialized and hash-verified as byte-identical C00 authority, not visual substitutes:\n  - C00-D BODY TURNAROUND — current handle `file_000000009b9481f4b02da66c73d24c45`, file `153fff4f-b445-4342-acd4-b3d260c14b8f.png`, SHA256 `49f1c5fa9973f185c4ed7441325e2705d392449f6d59b4592ec6d81bc4b4da82`.\n  - C00-C MASTER FRONT — current handle `file_000000001ec48246b4bafa0687984fe4`, file `8b45ccb3-e979-4422-9145-b873985424f7(4).png`, SHA256 `57fbec5d9c136a90c6ac262f8011665fa061dca427bf3fb2c3f110d1cb0a69ed`.\n  - C00-A COSTUME/ACCESSORY — current handle `file_000000007a8c81f4ba781fa5e4ae2798`, file `c0817ce2-23ed-4013-a18c-c2037cc0bd23.png`, SHA256 `94c185aea5755e569f8359fd29c6e0b8a1748e1613f2b59e7a3e280205dcbc8e`.\n- Those SHA256 values exactly match the durable C00 source register; visually-similar Library candidates were not promoted as authority.\n\n**SOURCE EVIDENCE**\n- Fresh `main` at execution start: `b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`.\n- Fresh `duncan/zorr-studio-r01` at execution start: `f67fd9454a6c2702e60b270634d934dc2ea62665`.\n- Frozen matrix blob on that HEAD: `f4693c7836f37794865de8f5c46eeb7c47cbe96b`.\n- Frozen witness protocol blob: `ecb0e58762358b6e0b6e79f3fa04e715e6f2d321`.\n- Upstream pack/body/hands hashes remain as frozen by #245. Exact `BODY_CONSTRUCTION_R01.png` bytes were not rediscovered in this bounded run; its frozen hash remains `08b86bc13a1fb001a9251717ccee3867c9b6573b44cfe7a96bba8fbaf26bb018`.\n\n**VISUAL EVIDENCE — REJECTED OUTPUTS**\nThree bounded W01 visual executions were produced and self-QA rejected. None is a witness asset:\n1. conversation artifact `file_00000000a83882108f40f49523698822`, SHA256 `7e32ae359b22180b71176b662a2eb8e44182ed62f70b0b26bac63ae7fc59a81f` — wrong black-suit character/report-board output; invented 3D/Blender provenance and self-declared PASS.\n2. conversation artifact `file_0000000060c88246bd275509ea8a97fd`, SHA256 `28ab83b3ad2a9f8d7ffd203b73c9a61ce618bf0f5efa7bc1a5c585135f52fe0c` — same failure class: report-board, wrong black suit/identity, invented handles/hashes and PASS.\n3. path-changed direct-source-edit attempt, conversation artifact `file_00000000a0888210808976934472f443`, SHA256 `e147f983f64909946e31948018243fcc2bdd265e83448f1bafd378009ceef12e` — still ignored the exact ivory source target and synthesized an unrelated black/red character/report with fabricated provenance.\n\nAfter two same-class failures, the third attempt changed execution path from general generation to explicit direct source edit. The same source-binding failure survived, so no fourth blind retry is legal.\n\n**W01 MATRIX RESULT**\n- `CONTROL_ID = W01 / ARM_RAISE`\n- `SOURCE_IDENTITY = PASS` for the three C00 inputs above (hash match).\n- `BODY_MODEL_PRESERVED = FAIL` in produced outputs.\n- `COSTUME_MODEL_PRESERVED = FAIL` (ivory double-breasted suit not preserved).\n- `IVORY_BLACK_HIERARCHY = FAIL`.\n- `NO_REDESIGN = FAIL`.\n- `FRAMING_COMPLIANCE = FAIL` (QA/report boards instead of clean diagnostic character artifact).\n- `ATTACHMENT_INVARIANTS = NOT EVALUABLE AS VALID W01` because source identity/costume failed first.\n- `FOLD_DIRECTION = NOT EVALUABLE AS VALID W01`.\n- `CALM_REGION_PRESERVED = NOT EVALUABLE AS VALID W01`.\n- `EXACT_FAILURE = VISUAL_EXECUTION_SOURCE_BINDING_NOT_HONORED`.\n- `VERDICT = FAIL`.\n\n**OPEN**\n- `REAL W01 VISUAL ARTIFACT = NOT PRESENT`.\n- `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 != PASS`.\n- Current physical blocker: this session's visual generation/editing surface does not bind/edit the supplied exact frozen source bytes; even an explicit direct-source edit produced unrelated synthesized report imagery.\n\n**NEXT**\n`DO NOT START W02`.\nNext legal action is a path change to a visual execution surface that can demonstrably accept the exact materialized source image bytes as edit/reference inputs. First fresh output must be W01 only, then hash + matrix QC. No more blind retries on the current failure signature.",
